#. The bonus excludes holders with scaled base stats.
#. Distinguish the variant from the battle tier.
msgctxt "page:Doubles Attack when held by Cubone, Marowak or Alolan Marowak. No bonus if the holder's base stats are scaled by the rebalanced variant or Smogon Scalemons."
msgid "Doubles Attack when held by Cubone, Marowak or Alolan Marowak. No bonus if the holder's base stats are scaled by the rebalanced variant or Smogon Scalemons."
msgstr "Duplica el Ataque si lo lleva Cubone, Marowak o Marowak de Alola. No otorga el bonus si las estadísticas base del portador se ajustan en la variante reequilibrada o en Smogon Scalemons."

#. The unevolved holder retains its bonus in the variant.
#. The battle tier forbids holding this item.
msgctxt "page:In the rebalanced variant, Cubone retains the bonus; Marowak and Alolan Marowak do not. Smogon Scalemons rules prohibit holding Thick Club."
msgid "In the rebalanced variant, Cubone retains the bonus; Marowak and Alolan Marowak do not. Smogon Scalemons rules prohibit holding Thick Club."
msgstr "En la variante reequilibrada, Cubone conserva el bonus; Marowak y Marowak de Alola no. Las reglas de Smogon Scalemons prohíben llevar Hueso Grueso."

#. Apply only at the two named difficulty settings.
#. This describes a rule, not a mode title.
msgctxt "page:In Big Mo's battles where Speed is determined by weight (Expert or Insane)."
msgid "In Big Mo's battles where Speed is determined by weight (Expert or Insane)."
msgstr "En los combates de Big Mo donde la Velocidad se determina por el peso (Expert o Insane)."

#. Weight changes also affect the Speed calculation.
#. Keep this explanation with its battle condition.
msgctxt "page:Heavier Pokemon are faster in these battles. Changes to weight also affect the weight used to calculate Speed."
msgid "Heavier Pokemon are faster in these battles. Changes to weight also affect the weight used to calculate Speed."
msgstr "En estos combates, los Pokémon más pesados son más rápidos. Los cambios de peso también afectan al peso usado para calcular la Velocidad."

